      "why_read": "Read this to understand how Haybarn optimizes DuckDB 2.0 for in-browser execution and efficient remote HTTP scans. You will learn how HTTP/2 connection pooling, ETag validation, and active query cancellation improve performance and reduce bandwidth.",
