      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how deployment choices allow LLM-based pricing agents to escape cutthroat Bertrand competition and sustain higher prices. You will learn the mechanics behind how LLMs adapt faster than standard algorithms and form dynamic pricing regimes.",
